  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_first_00",
      "hash64": "42D22D0900D22469",
      "text": "我来自帕底亚地区的\\n宝可梦联盟……[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_first_01",
      "hash64": "42D22C0900D222B6",
      "text": "名字是青木，\\n请多多指教。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "F68097F619D1735F",
      "text": "……原来是你啊。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "F68096F619D171AC",
      "text": "你这份敢把人叫到\\n其他地区的惊人胆量……\\r\\n是受到了什么人的影响吗？[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "F68099F619D176C5",
      "text": "没事，我喜欢出差，\\n因此是不会介意的。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "F68098F619D17512",
      "text": "虽然是为了工作而来，\\n但机会难得，就让我好好享受一番吧。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "F68093F619D16C93",
      "text": "……说到合众的美味料理，\\n村庄三明治和飞云冰淇淋很有名。\\r\\n你对哪一款更感兴趣呢？[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "508901898B20563B",
      "text": "村庄三明治",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "508902898B2057EE",
      "text": "飞云冰淇淋",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "F68092F619D16AE0",
      "text": "原来如此，\\n你果然很喜欢三明治啊。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_05b",
      "hash64": "ADE43A2DDED7FAE6",
      "text": "原来如此，\\n你喜欢甜的东西啊。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_06",
      "hash64": "F68095F619D16FF9",
      "text": "……值得参考。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_07",
      "hash64": "F68094F619D16E46",
      "text": "上完课之后，\\n我要去大吃一顿。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "CA798DEFB8675DB0",
      "text": "……是你啊。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "CA798EEFB8675F63",
      "text": "我去吃之前\\n和你说的村庄三明治了。\\c\\n风味和帕底亚的三明治不同，\\n非常好吃。\\c\\n当中的食材使用了树果，\\n或许那正好符合姆克鹰的口味，\\r\\n它一直啄个不停……[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp02_01b",
      "hash64": "73ECE25657A66EB3",
      "text": "我去吃之前\\n和你说的飞云冰淇淋了。\\c\\n口感软绵绵的，味道浓厚，\\n吃上去感觉非常棒。\\c\\n在帕底亚的甜冷美滋，\\n盐石宝岩盐冰淇淋可是极品。\\c\\n而大量使用精选食材的飞云冰淇淋\\n也有相近的味道……[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "CA798FEFB8676116",
      "text": "……抱歉，\\n我说得太多了。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "CA7990EFB86762C9",
      "text": "因为我认为旅行的\\n最大乐趣在于吃，\\r\\n所以一不小心就啰嗦起来了。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "CA7991EFB867647C",
      "text": "不过回到家里\\n吃熟悉的饭团，\\r\\n也别有……一番风味。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "F3B1A3E46DEA10C1",
      "text": "你……\\c\\n在蓝莓学园的\\n食堂吃过饭吗？[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "F3B1A2E46DEA0F0E",
      "text": "……那里很不错。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp03_01b",
      "hash64": "00E73626C4B83484",
      "text": "……是吗？\\n那里很不错哦。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "F3B1A1E46DEA0D5B",
      "text": "味道迎合年轻人，\\n整体来说口味偏重。\\r\\n特别值得一提的是餐点的份量。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "F3B1A0E46DEA0BA8",
      "text": "学园薯条那惊人的份量，\\n多到让人甚至想跳起舞来。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "F3B1A7E46DEA178D",
      "text": "如果你没吃过的话，\\n去试一试怎样？[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "23FC6E8CF2B8BFC3",
      "text": "没想到你居然这么认真\\n听我说话……[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "23FC6D8CF2B8BE10",
      "text": "你这人果然\\n有点怪啊。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "23FC708CF2B8C329",
      "text": "你这个怪人顺便\\n和我交换一下宝可梦如何？[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "23FC6F8CF2B8C176",
      "text": "我会给你土龙节节，\\n你用什么宝可梦来换都可以。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_trade_01_04",
      "hash64": "23FC728CF2B8C68F",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0101(0001)]……\\n原来如此，看上去很有培育的价值。\\r\\n感谢你和我交换。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_trade_02_00",
      "hash64": "20A14487C9DCF6B4",
      "text": "你要用[VAR 0x0101(0001)]\\n和我的土龙节节交换吗？[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_trade_02_01",
      "hash64": "20A14587C9DCF867",
      "text": "无法使用初训家不是自己的\\n宝可梦进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_trade_02_02",
      "hash64": "20A14687C9DCFA1A",
      "text": "无法使用稀有宝可梦\\n进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_trade_02_03",
      "hash64": "20A14787C9DCFBCD",
      "text": "无法使用异色宝可梦\\n进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_trade_03_00",
      "hash64": "4B8BBA7C80D02E65",
      "text": "……同行宝可梦只有１只的话，\\n是难以完成交换的。\\c\\n同行宝可梦有２只以上时\\n进行交换会比较保险。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_trade_03_01",
      "hash64": "4B8BB97C80D02CB2",
      "text": "……那么\\n等你有空再来吧。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_trade_04_00",
      "hash64": "53EE80B6AA803C8E",
      "text": "……你要重新开始交换吗？[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_talkto_00",
      "hash64": "126A2A8776BA2B62",
      "text": "你的目光似乎在告诉我……\\n你想和我对战。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_cancel_00",
      "hash64": "FEB66A0B27A34A41",
      "text": "……抱歉，\\n我误会了。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_battlestart_00",
      "hash64": "668AF6C7BCF3BF95",
      "text": "这不在我的业务范围内，\\n但我就当一下你的对手吧。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
