    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_battleend_win_01_00",
      "hash64": "254DF25C3A838DFB",
      "text": "请让我送这个给你，\\n今天就到此为止吧……[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_battleend_win_01_01",
      "hash64": "254DF15C3A838C48",
      "text": "那么，失陪了。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_battleend_lose_00_00",
      "hash64": "B5FD9D7C5C485681",
      "text": "你也会有\\n失败的时候啊。\\r\\n人生……总有跌宕起伏。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_randomtalk_00",
      "hash64": "36566AE3B87009CC",
      "text": "我自己也觉得锦汇道馆的\\n道馆测验设计得很好。\\c\\n通过让挑战者们互相对战\\n来缩减人数这点非常棒。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_randomtalk_01",
      "hash64": "36566BE3B8700B7F",
      "text": "难道首席给你\\n添什么麻烦了吗？\\c\\n不情愿的事情要明确拒绝，\\n否则会变得心神不宁哦。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_randomtalk_02",
      "hash64": "36566CE3B8700D32",
      "text": "在四天王测验中，\\n把八朔排在我后面这点很不好。\\c\\n要是前面的人是辛俐或波琵的话，\\n即使不大声叫他，他应该也能注意到。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_randomtalk_03",
      "hash64": "36566DE3B8700EE5",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0101(0001)]它很有精神，\\n应该不是在硬撑。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_randomtalk_04",
      "hash64": "365666E3B8700300",
      "text": "之前交换给你的\\n土龙节节过得怎样？\\c\\n它是能够太晶化为飞行属性的\\n飞翔土龙节节……切记这一点哦。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_randomtalk_sp",
      "hash64": "3587BCE3B7C0F8E7",
      "text": "……前段时间\\n首席联系了我。\\c\\n她说你把我\\n选为了你\\r\\n最喜欢的道馆馆主……\\c\\n我很难理解为什么\\n你会指定我这样平凡的男人。\\c\\n如果是因为疲劳导致你的判断力下降，\\n那我就介绍个好公园给你吧。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
